sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant O as Coordinator
    participant C as converter (dict + own tool)
    participant P as poet (compiled graph)
    U->>O: "convert 25C, and write a winter haiku"
    O->>C: task(subagent_type="converter")
    C->>C: celsius_to_fahrenheit(25)
    C-->>O: "25C is 77F"
    O->>P: task(subagent_type="poet")
    P-->>O: three-line haiku
    O-->>U: both results in one sentence
